{"seq":2,"slug":"molecular-genetics","title":"高三生物 — 分子遗传","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/genetics-review/molecular-genetics","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三生物-分子遗传\">高三生物 — 分子遗传</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>分子遗传学（基因的本质和表达）是连接细胞生物学和遗传学的桥梁，揭示了基因控制性状的分子机制。高考中这部分知识点以选择题和简答题的形式交替出现，核心考点包括 DNA 的结构和复制、基因的转录和翻译、基因表达的调控。</p>\n<p>分子遗传的核心概念链：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>关键知识</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DNA 结构</td>\n<td>遗传信息如何储存？</td>\n<td>双螺旋结构、碱基互补配对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNA 复制</td>\n<td>遗传信息如何传递？</td>\n<td>半保留复制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转录</td>\n<td>遗传信息如何从 DNA 到 RNA？</td>\n<td>以 DNA 一条链为模板合成 mRNA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>翻译</td>\n<td>遗传信息如何从 RNA 到蛋白质？</td>\n<td>mRNA 上的密码子指导氨基酸的排列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中心法则</td>\n<td>遗传信息流动的总规律</td>\n<td>DNA→RNA→蛋白质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-dna-的结构\">一、DNA 的结构</h3><p><strong>双螺旋结构模型</strong>（沃森和克里克，1953 年）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两条反向平行的脱氧核苷酸链围绕中心轴形成双螺旋</li>\n<li>外侧：磷酸—脱氧核糖交替排列构成骨架</li>\n<li>内侧：碱基互补配对（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>A-T</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{A-T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A-T</span></span></span></span></span></span> 两个氢键，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>G-C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{G-C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G-C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 三个氢键）</li>\n<li>碱基对的排列顺序（碱基序列）就是遗传信息</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>基因与 DNA 的关系</strong>：</p>\n<p>基因是有遗传效应的 DNA 片段。一个 DNA 分子上有多个基因，基因之间还有不编码蛋白质的间隔序列。</p>\n<p><strong>DNA 碱基计算</strong>：</p>\n<p>在双链 DNA 中：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>碱基总数</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + G = T + C = \\frac{\\text{碱基总数}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">碱基总数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>G+C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{G+C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G+C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 含量越高，DNA 热稳定性越好（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>G-C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{G-C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G-C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间有 3 个氢键）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-dna-的复制\">二、DNA 的复制</h3><p><strong>半保留复制</strong>：以两条母链各自作为模板，合成新的互补链。每个子代 DNA 分子包含一条母链和一条新合成的子链。</p>\n<p><strong>复制的特点</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>具体内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时期</td>\n<td>细胞分裂间期（有丝分裂和减数分裂之前）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场所</td>\n<td>细胞核（主要）、线粒体、叶绿体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模板</td>\n<td>DNA 的两条母链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原料</td>\n<td>四种游离的脱氧核苷酸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酶</td>\n<td>解旋酶（解开双链）、DNA 聚合酶（催化磷酸二酯键形成）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能量</td>\n<td>ATP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方式</td>\n<td>半保留复制、双向复制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>DNA 复制的计算</strong>：</p>\n<p>一个 DNA 分子复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次后：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产生 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个 DNA 分子</li>\n<li>含原始母链的 DNA 分子有 2 个</li>\n<li>消耗游离脱氧核苷酸 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(2^n - 1) \\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span> 原来的碱基数</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三-基因的表达-转录\">三、基因的表达——转录</h3><p><strong>转录的过程</strong>：以 DNA 的一条链（模板链）为模板，合成 mRNA。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>转录</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模板</td>\n<td>DNA 的一条链（模板链 / 反义链）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原料</td>\n<td>四种游离的核糖核苷酸（A、U、G、C）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酶</td>\n<td>RNA 聚合酶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场所</td>\n<td>细胞核（主要）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>产物</td>\n<td>mRNA（信使 RNA）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>碱基配对规则（转录时）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>A-U</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{A-U}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">A-U</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>T-A</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{T-A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T-A</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>G-C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{G-C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G-C</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>C-G</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C-G}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C-G</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3 id=\"四-基因的表达-翻译\">四、基因的表达——翻译</h3><p><strong>翻译的过程</strong>：以 mRNA 为模板，在核糖体上合成蛋白质。</p>\n<p><strong>三种 RNA 的分工</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RNA 类型</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>mRNA（信使 RNA）</td>\n<td>携带遗传信息，每 3 个碱基构成一个密码子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tRNA（转运 RNA）</td>\n<td>识别密码子，搬运氨基酸到核糖体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rRNA（核糖体 RNA）</td>\n<td>与蛋白质组成核糖体，翻译的场所</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>密码子</strong>：mRNA 上每 3 个相邻碱基决定一种氨基酸。共 64 个密码子，其中 61 个编码氨基酸，3 个为终止密码子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UAA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UAA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UAA</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UAG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UAG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UAG</span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>UGA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{UGA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">UGA</span></span></span></span></span></span>），1 个为起始密码子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>AUG</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{AUG}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AUG</span></span></span></span></span></span>，同时编码甲硫氨酸）。</p>\n<p><strong>反密码子</strong>：tRNA 上与密码子互补配对的 3 个碱基。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-中心法则\">五、中心法则</h3><p><strong>经典中心法则</strong>（克里克，1958 年）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DNA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>转录</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>RNA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>翻译</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>蛋白质</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DNA} \\xrightarrow{\\text{转录}} \\text{RNA} \\xrightarrow{\\text{翻译}} \\text{蛋白质}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">转录</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">翻译</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">蛋白质</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>DNA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>复制</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>DNA</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DNA} \\xrightarrow{\\text{复制}} \\text{DNA}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">复制</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>补充的中心法则</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RNA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>逆转录</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>DNA</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>HIV 等逆转录病毒</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RNA} \\xrightarrow{\\text{逆转录}} \\text{DNA} \\quad (\\text{HIV 等逆转录病毒})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">逆转录</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HIV </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">等逆转录病毒</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RNA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>复制</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>RNA</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>RNA 病毒</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RNA} \\xrightarrow{\\text{复制}} \\text{RNA} \\quad (\\text{RNA 病毒})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">复制</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RNA </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">病毒</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"六-基因控制性状的两条途径\">六、基因控制性状的两条途径</h3><p><strong>途径一</strong>：基因通过控制酶的合成来控制代谢过程，从而间接控制性状。</p>\n<p>例：豌豆的淀粉分支酶基因 → 淀粉分支酶 → 淀粉合成 → 圆粒。基因突变 → 酶缺失 → 蔗糖不能转化为淀粉 → 皱粒。</p>\n<p><strong>途径二</strong>：基因通过控制蛋白质的结构来直接控制性状。</p>\n<p>例：镰刀型细胞贫血症。基因中一个碱基对替换 → mRNA 上一个密码子改变 → 一个氨基酸替换（谷氨酸→缬氨酸） → 血红蛋白异常 → 红细胞呈镰刀形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一段 DNA 双链共有 200 个碱基对，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>G</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{G}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">G</span></span></span></span></span></span> 有 80 个。该 DNA 分子连续复制 3 次需要消耗多少个游离的腺嘌呤脱氧核苷酸？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某基因的模板链碱基序列为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mtext>TACGGATCC</mtext><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&#x27;-\\text{TACGGATCC}-5&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8352em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TACGGATCC</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。写出由该基因转录出的 mRNA 的碱基序列和对应的氨基酸序列（查密码子表）。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>在中心法则的框架下，解释为什么 HIV（人类免疫缺陷病毒）需要逆转录酶才能在宿主细胞中增殖。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>基因突变中&quot;碱基对的增添&quot;对蛋白质的影响比&quot;碱基对的替换&quot;大得多。试解释原因。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>分子遗传学的奠基性发现几乎都诞生于 20 世纪中叶。1944 年艾弗里证明 DNA 是遗传物质，1953 年沃森和克里克提出双螺旋模型，1958 年梅塞尔森和斯塔尔用密度梯度离心实验证实了半保留复制，1961 年尼伦伯格和马太破译了第一个遗传密码。这些发现如同多米诺骨牌一样迅速改变了人类对生命本质的理解。</p>\n<p>基因编辑技术（CRISPR-Cas9）的发明使人类能够精确修改 DNA 序列。2020 年诺贝尔化学奖授予了开发该技术的两位女科学家。高考虽然不直接考查基因编辑的技术细节，但理解中心法则和基因突变的原理是理解基因编辑的基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分子遗传的复习以中心法则为主线：DNA 复制保证遗传信息的代代相传，转录和翻译实现遗传信息的表达。DNA 的双螺旋结构和碱基互补配对是所有分子遗传过程的物质基础。密码子的简并性、基因突变的类型和效果、基因控制性状的两条途径是高考的核心考点。掌握 DNA 复制的数量计算和基因表达的碱基对应关系是必备技能。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三生物 — 分子遗传","id":"高三生物-分子遗传"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、DNA 的结构","id":"一-dna-的结构"},{"level":3,"text":"二、DNA 的复制","id":"二-dna-的复制"},{"level":3,"text":"三、基因的表达——转录","id":"三-基因的表达-转录"},{"level":3,"text":"四、基因的表达——翻译","id":"四-基因的表达-翻译"},{"level":3,"text":"五、中心法则","id":"五-中心法则"},{"level":3,"text":"六、基因控制性状的两条途径","id":"六-基因控制性状的两条途径"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三生物 — 遗传定律","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/genetics-review/genetic-laws"},"next":{"title":"高三生物 — 变异与进化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/biology/genetics-review/variation-evolution"}}